+++# Design — tool-call-risk-gate
+++
+++## Approach
+++
+++The seam is `run_cmd::run`, the one place a `moor run`/`moor keel` argv
+++crosses from host to `docker exec`. Nothing upstream of it (main.rs's
+++dispatch, keel_cmd.rs's argv-building) needs to change — both already
+++call `run_cmd::run`, so gating there covers both callers for free.
